From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dvir Zaguri <dzaguri@nvidia.com>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 12:00:00 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 6.12 1/1] arm64: dts: aspeed: spc6-bmc: disable sdram EDAC on
 SONiC

The 6.12.94 Aspeed base enables the aspeed,ast2700-sdram-edac node at
sdram@12c00000. SPC6 runs without DRAM ECC, so the driver refuses to
probe and logs at error level on every boot:

  aspeed-edac 12c00000.sdram: ECC mode is not configured in u-boot
  aspeed-edac 12c00000.sdram: probe with driver aspeed-edac failed with error -1

Disable the node for the SONiC SPC6 DTS. The base DTS has no label for
it, so reference it by path.

Signed-off-by: Dvir Zaguri <dzaguri@nvidia.com>
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/aspeed/nvidia-ast27xx-sunda-sonic.dtsi | 5 +++++
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/aspeed/nvidia-ast27xx-sunda-sonic.dtsi b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/aspeed/nvidia-ast27xx-sunda-sonic.dtsi
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/aspeed/nvidia-ast27xx-sunda-sonic.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/aspeed/nvidia-ast27xx-sunda-sonic.dtsi
@@ -6,3 +6,8 @@
 &otp {
 	status = "okay";
 };
+
+// No DRAM ECC on SPC6: aspeed-edac fails probe with an error otherwise.
+&{/soc@10000000/sdram@12c00000} {
+	status = "disabled";
+};
-- 
